       "cap": "$\\kDeltamuone$ is the molar Gibbs energy of fusion of the solvent, so the Gibbs–Helmholtz equation brings in its molar enthalpy of fusion."
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{l}{\\dfrac{\\partial \\ln a_1}{\\partial \\kT}} = \\mk{r}{\\dfrac{\\kDeltafusHone}{\\kR\\kT^2}}",
